WEBVTT

00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:01.060
Today marks the 10th anniversary of the Fuyuki Fire.

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:04.220
A memorial service is underway at the city's central park.

00:01:06.350 --> 00:01:11.360
The cause of the disaster that claimed
over 500 lives remains a mystery.

00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:15.150
At the disaster site, the ground remains scarred.

00:01:15.150 --> 00:01:22.450
About 400 of the bereaved offer prayers
and flowers to the victims.

00:01:30.170 --> 00:01:33.130
I can't eat another bite.

00:01:35.380 --> 00:01:37.840
It's getting late.

00:01:41.180 --> 00:01:43.560
I should be going.

00:01:45.640 --> 00:01:48.690
I'll take you home. It's not safe out.

00:01:50.150 --> 00:01:53.020
Don't forget to lock up.

00:01:53.020 --> 00:01:56.650
That's a no-no, Kiritsugu.

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:02.620
Thanks.

00:02:02.660 --> 00:02:07.960
Are you kidding? You were a great help.

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:13.500
Well, it's fun having dinner with a lot of people.
Beats eating alone.

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:20.590
Your hand!

00:02:22.300 --> 00:02:24.640
I must've cut it cleaning up.

00:02:25.430 --> 00:02:27.020
Hear thee!

00:02:27.100 --> 00:02:29.270
I command thee to my side.

00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:32.100
And entrust my fate in thy sword.

00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:34.570
Heeding to Holy Grail's refuge.

00:02:34.650 --> 00:02:38.740
If thou surrender to this will and reason,
answer my call.

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:40.360
Offer thine oath.

00:02:40.450 --> 00:02:43.740
I embody Virtue in the Eternal World.

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:47.160
I chastise Evil in the Eternal World.

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:51.670
Thou art the Seven Heavens
harboring the great spirit trinity.

00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:00.380
Come forth O Keeper of Balance!

00:03:17.780 --> 00:03:20.240
The Holy Grail Wars.

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:23.160
Seven Magi locked for centuries
in an epic struggle...

00:03:23.240 --> 00:03:26.830
for a Holy Grail that can grant its owner
every wish and absolute power.

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:32.540
In their battles, the Magi enlist the help
of astral spirits called Servants.

00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:38.420
Meanwhile, the Holy Grail
awaits the emergence of a victor.

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:44.300
A single human Magi it deems
most worthy of its stewardship.

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:51.100
The Servants are spirits of legendary heroes
from history to whom the Grail has given flesh.

00:03:51.810 --> 00:03:56.480
They exist on an astral plane
and accompany the Magi.

00:03:57.110 --> 00:04:03.070
But when necessary can be summoned as
material beings and made to battle each other.

00:04:03.740 --> 00:04:07.070
Such is the Grail's miraculous power.

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:11.250
And he who can obtain it...
shall be master of the universe.

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:13.120
Who's there?

00:04:20.590 --> 00:04:23.840
Oh no! Someone's still here.

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:36.230
Yo.

00:04:38.650 --> 00:04:40.110
Time to die.

00:05:48.050 --> 00:05:51.850
I am Servant Saber. You summoned me.

00:05:58.020 --> 00:05:59.390
I ask you.

00:06:02.110 --> 00:06:04.440
Are you my Master?

00:06:38.890 --> 00:06:40.480
Shiro Emiya.

00:06:41.310 --> 00:06:45.270
You now inhabit a new world...

00:06:45.270 --> 00:06:49.650
...where you must learn to kill or be killed.

00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:54.530
For you are now a Master.

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:57.790
I will fight.

00:06:57.870 --> 00:07:03.080
I'll end this senseless war.

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:11.550
Be happy, young man.

00:07:12.050 --> 00:07:14.930
Your wish is at last fulfilled.

00:07:16.310 --> 00:07:17.930
No posturing necessary.

00:07:18.350 --> 00:07:22.100
As a human, your struggle is a just one.

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:31.400
Hey, you realize that we're
supposed to be enemies.

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:32.780
Enemies?

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:41.750
I brought you to Kirei's church
because you didn't know anything.

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:44.500
But you're a Magus now, right?

00:07:44.830 --> 00:07:47.790
That leaves only one thing for us to do.

00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:49.210
Oh, yeah.

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:51.130
What're you doing?

00:07:51.130 --> 00:07:54.220
Don't give your enemy time to prepare.

00:07:54.220 --> 00:07:56.550
I know that!

00:07:56.550 --> 00:07:59.010
Then make a move.

00:07:59.020 --> 00:08:02.100
Don't tell me you plan to show mercy.

00:08:02.100 --> 00:08:04.060
'Course not!

00:08:06.150 --> 00:08:07.650
It's just that...

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:13.240
I want to fight fair. That's all.

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:15.490
How tiresome.

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:20.450
Let's call it a day.

00:08:20.450 --> 00:08:24.750
Starting tomorrow, though... we're enemies.

00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:26.290
Gotcha.

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:29.170
Hey, Tosaka... you're all right.

00:08:29.170 --> 00:08:33.800
What? Stop that!
Don't think I'll go easy on you.

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:35.340
I understand.

00:08:35.340 --> 00:08:39.260
But I'd rather we didn't have to be enemies.

00:08:39.930 --> 00:08:43.100
You're just the sort of person...

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:45.100
...I admire.

00:08:56.240 --> 00:08:58.410
Look, just be careful, all right?

00:08:58.950 --> 00:09:03.700
Saber may be good, but if
you get yourself killed, it's all over.

00:09:14.510 --> 00:09:18.010
Illyasviel! And Berserker!

00:09:24.390 --> 00:09:26.430
Stand back, Shiro!

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:32.610
Crush him, Berserker.

00:10:03.430 --> 00:10:04.600
Saber!

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:20.200
An invisible sword.

00:10:56.730 --> 00:10:57.690
Saber!

00:11:57.250 --> 00:11:58.290
Saber!

00:11:58.300 --> 00:12:00.260
No! You wanna die?!

00:12:00.260 --> 00:12:02.010
I can't leave Saber.

00:12:06.010 --> 00:12:06.970
Shiro!

00:12:08.220 --> 00:12:09.310
Archer?

00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:13.270
Get out of the way? Of what?

00:13:13.660 --> 00:13:14.950
Shiro!

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:19.460
That's...

00:13:19.460 --> 00:13:21.420
Archer's weapon.

00:13:25.260 --> 00:13:29.180
Like Berserker, he was aiming for me...

00:13:32.890 --> 00:13:36.390
Unconcerned by you and
Tosaka's presence nearby.

00:13:45.610 --> 00:13:47.610
I'm impressed, Rin.

00:13:48.110 --> 00:13:50.870
Your Archer is pretty good.

00:13:56.540 --> 00:13:58.710
Let's go home, Berserker.

00:14:03.460 --> 00:14:08.010
Bye-bye. See you soon, Big Brother.

00:14:15.220 --> 00:14:16.390
Shiro!

00:14:17.390 --> 00:14:18.850
Emiya!

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:41.830
Are you serious?

00:14:41.830 --> 00:14:45.300
Berserker is stronger than l expected.

00:14:46.090 --> 00:14:51.550
Fighting Saber and Shiro isn't wise right now.

00:14:53.930 --> 00:14:57.350
I beg to differ. They're an encumbrance.

00:14:57.350 --> 00:14:59.180
Reconsider, Rin.

00:14:59.350 --> 00:15:01.900
Are you disobeying your Master?

00:15:10.820 --> 00:15:15.200
I can't do that. As long as you're my Master.

00:15:15.280 --> 00:15:16.780
Wait.

00:15:17.790 --> 00:15:22.370
You haven't yet told me what Epic Spirit you are.

00:15:22.880 --> 00:15:25.840
Do you recall your real name?

00:15:26.210 --> 00:15:28.460
No, not yet.

00:15:31.800 --> 00:15:33.930
My memory betrays me.

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:37.720
Shall I tell you why?

00:15:38.600 --> 00:15:41.770
Because you summoned me prematurely.

00:15:43.690 --> 00:15:45.810
Why you conceited... Hey!

00:15:45.810 --> 00:15:48.400
Get back here and help me move!

00:16:14.590 --> 00:16:16.340
Ow.

00:16:20.270 --> 00:16:21.640
A dream?

00:16:24.020 --> 00:16:25.770
May I have more?

00:16:25.850 --> 00:16:27.020
Of course.

00:16:27.110 --> 00:16:29.320
You're not a fussy eater?

00:16:29.400 --> 00:16:34.110
No. if prepared well, I can eat anything.

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:38.620
How do you stay so slim eating so much?
I'm jealous!

00:16:38.830 --> 00:16:40.160
Morning!

00:16:40.160 --> 00:16:42.580
I'm starving! I need nourishment!

00:16:54.380 --> 00:16:59.350
Hey! Since when are we running a guesthouse?

00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:02.430
You'd better have a good answer.

00:17:02.890 --> 00:17:04.770
My apologies.

00:17:05.560 --> 00:17:10.310
l should've told you sooner, Miss Fujimura.

00:17:11.190 --> 00:17:13.780
My home is being renovated and...

00:17:17.320 --> 00:17:19.030
You don't say!

00:17:20.030 --> 00:17:24.200
Then your sister arrived from overseas, huh?

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:27.080
Sounds hectic.

00:17:27.120 --> 00:17:31.340
I planned to take off school and stay in a hotel.

00:17:31.550 --> 00:17:35.050
But then Shiro offered to help.

00:17:35.800 --> 00:17:37.930
I didn't want to impose but...

00:17:38.430 --> 00:17:40.010
Don't be silly!

00:17:40.010 --> 00:17:44.560
This house and Shiro...

00:17:44.560 --> 00:17:46.430
...are yours to do as you please.

00:17:46.980 --> 00:17:48.730
Thank you.

00:17:48.730 --> 00:17:49.810
Refill!

00:17:49.810 --> 00:17:50.810
Me too, please.

00:17:50.810 --> 00:17:52.070
Of course.

00:17:53.650 --> 00:17:57.570
Sakura, you'll be late for training. Hurry!

00:17:57.820 --> 00:18:00.200
Coming. Sorry.

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:01.950
Let's move!

00:18:01.950 --> 00:18:02.950
Okay.

00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:06.160
Following me to school?

00:18:06.330 --> 00:18:09.210
Servants protect their Magi.

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:11.960
The school's full of people.

00:18:11.960 --> 00:18:14.670
I'll be fine. You wait here.

00:18:18.550 --> 00:18:22.470
If you say so, Master,
I've no choice but to believe you.

00:18:23.100 --> 00:18:25.640
But promise me one thing.

00:18:28.390 --> 00:18:31.440
If you sense any danger, call me.

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:36.230
If you feel you need my help,
those thoughts will reach me.

00:18:36.440 --> 00:18:39.950
But if there isn't enough time,
use a Command Spell.

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:42.450
Okay. I promise.

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:46.870
Homurabara Academy
Senior High School

00:19:03.640 --> 00:19:05.810
What is this?

00:19:07.140 --> 00:19:10.770
This sickeningly sweet sensation...

00:19:23.030 --> 00:19:25.410
Yo Emiya!

00:19:25.410 --> 00:19:27.080
Hurry or you'll be tardy.

00:19:27.080 --> 00:19:28.490
Shinji.

00:19:28.620 --> 00:19:32.290
What's wrong? You look a little pale.

00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:36.340
Nothing. Just felt dizzy for a second.

00:19:36.340 --> 00:19:40.800
Don't worry me, all right? You look like death.

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:48.390
A force field?

00:19:48.470 --> 00:19:53.980
There's another Magus at this school.
He's cast a force field around it.

00:19:54.400 --> 00:19:57.060
So that's what l felt.

00:19:57.230 --> 00:19:59.610
But for what aim?

00:19:59.610 --> 00:20:04.910
Servants store up mana
by consuming spiritual energy.

00:20:04.910 --> 00:20:09.660
By feeding on the students,
he strengthens his Servant.

00:20:09.830 --> 00:20:11.200
How cowardly!

00:20:11.210 --> 00:20:16.460
The force field is weak. l can keep it neutralized.

00:20:16.460 --> 00:20:19.130
We'd better find this Magus.

00:20:23.010 --> 00:20:24.220
Hear that?

00:20:24.220 --> 00:20:25.800
A scream.

00:20:26.720 --> 00:20:28.390
Emiya, wait!

00:20:36.190 --> 00:20:38.810
She must've just fainted.

00:20:38.820 --> 00:20:42.820
That's not it. Her vitality's been drained.

00:20:42.820 --> 00:20:45.570
Wait, l think I can revive her.

00:21:07.510 --> 00:21:09.050
See to her.

00:21:10.010 --> 00:21:10.970
Emiya!

00:21:43.170 --> 00:21:46.380
I didn't expect you'd wander over here alone.

00:21:47.880 --> 00:21:49.220
Shinji!

00:22:03.110 --> 00:22:07.400
Aren't you going to call your Servant?

00:22:08.320 --> 00:22:12.990
Emiya's a bit slow. I'm sure he's forgotten how.

00:22:15.540 --> 00:22:20.170
So you're the one responsible for this force field.

00:22:20.460 --> 00:22:25.840
Correct. And I can kill
anyone in it, if I so choose.

00:22:25.840 --> 00:22:27.510
Stop it!

00:22:28.010 --> 00:22:33.720
What? Who are you to give me orders?

00:22:34.140 --> 00:22:35.850
Shinji!

00:22:36.220 --> 00:22:39.810
You annoy me, Emiya.

00:22:39.810 --> 00:22:41.150
Just die.

00:23:08.340 --> 00:23:10.010
Let's go, Rider.

00:23:14.220 --> 00:23:16.510
So he's our perpetrator.

00:23:16.520 --> 00:23:18.430
Yeah, it's Shinji.

00:23:18.430 --> 00:23:20.600
How's the girl?

00:23:20.600 --> 00:23:22.230
She'll be okay.

00:23:58.060 --> 00:23:59.180
Shiro!

00:24:07.770 --> 00:24:09.020
Come...

00:24:11.150 --> 00:24:13.700
Saber!

00:24:29.920 --> 00:24:30.920
Shiro!

00:24:30.960 --> 00:24:32.920
They're all yours, Saber.

00:24:33.050 --> 00:24:34.430
Understood, Master.

00:24:51.860 --> 00:24:55.110
Ashes to ashes... dust to dust.

00:25:08.130 --> 00:25:09.960
Let's get the force field's source!

00:25:29.400 --> 00:25:30.730
Oh God.

00:25:41.160 --> 00:25:43.240
Shinji! Why you...!

00:25:45.080 --> 00:25:48.460
No! No, no, no, no!

00:25:48.460 --> 00:25:50.830
No? How dare you!

00:25:51.340 --> 00:25:54.340
Dissolve the force field now!

00:25:54.970 --> 00:25:58.590
It wasn't me. I didn't kill them!

00:26:05.230 --> 00:26:07.020
It was the Servant.

00:26:20.160 --> 00:26:23.910
It wasn't me! Rider was obeying another!

00:26:24.330 --> 00:26:25.950
Who?

00:26:26.000 --> 00:26:27.710
I don't know!

00:26:39.510 --> 00:26:45.060
It's my fault. l was careless.

00:26:45.600 --> 00:26:47.180
They're breathing.

00:26:48.100 --> 00:26:49.600
It's not too late!

00:26:50.770 --> 00:26:53.190
They're all still alive.

00:26:56.780 --> 00:26:59.190
Emiya, thank you.

00:27:00.160 --> 00:27:01.410
No, really.

00:27:01.490 --> 00:27:04.660
You stayed calm. I'm impressed.

00:27:04.830 --> 00:27:07.370
We both lost ourselves a bit.

00:27:08.290 --> 00:27:12.960
I'm used to seeing corpses. So l knew. That's all.

00:27:13.170 --> 00:27:14.380
You are?

00:27:16.340 --> 00:27:19.550
I'm surprised to see Saber here.

00:27:20.340 --> 00:27:23.390
Yeah, where were you?

00:27:24.350 --> 00:27:28.060
I came the moment
I sensed my Master in danger.

00:27:28.060 --> 00:27:31.310
But by then it was over.

00:27:31.310 --> 00:27:34.520
You're damn right it was!

00:27:35.020 --> 00:27:39.070
Would you like to hear all about it?

00:27:39.070 --> 00:27:44.110
While you were goofing off,
Shiro and I had our hands full!

00:27:44.370 --> 00:27:47.660
Unwilling to fight, young man?

00:27:47.660 --> 00:27:51.120
Without a Servant, how can I?

00:27:51.120 --> 00:27:53.670
Rider was in it for herself!

00:27:53.670 --> 00:27:55.790
So it's the Servant's fault?

00:27:55.790 --> 00:27:59.800
Yeah. It wasn't my fault we lost.

00:27:59.800 --> 00:28:04.050
And them... acting all high and mighty!

00:28:04.050 --> 00:28:07.350
So you still desire to fight?

00:28:07.970 --> 00:28:09.680
You're in luck.

00:28:09.850 --> 00:28:13.560
There just happens to be a Servant available.

00:28:17.400 --> 00:28:18.730
Come.

00:28:24.820 --> 00:28:26.070
Come.

00:28:29.040 --> 00:28:30.580
Come.

00:28:40.630 --> 00:28:42.010
Come...

00:28:43.590 --> 00:28:45.010
Come...

00:28:46.850 --> 00:28:48.300
Come...

00:28:50.600 --> 00:28:51.890
Come...

00:28:53.640 --> 00:28:55.390
Come...

00:28:56.860 --> 00:28:58.610
Come!

00:28:59.980 --> 00:29:01.320
Welcome.

00:29:12.830 --> 00:29:17.830
Let's have Saber destroy
that eyesore, Berserker.

00:29:18.290 --> 00:29:20.090
To do so...

00:29:20.170 --> 00:29:22.460
I'll need that Command Spell.

00:29:48.530 --> 00:29:49.410
Who are you?!

00:29:49.700 --> 00:29:53.950
Protector of Ryudo Temple,
the Servant Assassin.

00:29:53.950 --> 00:29:55.790
You wish to pass?

00:29:57.670 --> 00:29:59.670
Try if you dare.

00:30:31.830 --> 00:30:34.280
You! Why'd you come?

00:30:34.790 --> 00:30:37.080
Just passing through.

00:30:39.000 --> 00:30:42.380
Archer! Assassin, where were you?

00:30:42.380 --> 00:30:46.420
How curious. Two Servants in one place.

00:30:46.420 --> 00:30:52.090
Caster, I see your Magus and
Assassin's Magus are in league.

00:30:53.140 --> 00:30:54.810
In league?

00:30:55.560 --> 00:30:58.810
With that mere pawn of a man?

00:30:59.100 --> 00:31:02.560
Then you've broken the rules.

00:31:02.730 --> 00:31:07.650
Oh? I am a Magus
who has summoned a Servant.

00:31:07.820 --> 00:31:09.400
Is that a problem?

00:31:10.030 --> 00:31:12.780
You're stealing human souls.

00:31:12.780 --> 00:31:16.160
And using Assassin to fight for you.

00:31:25.250 --> 00:31:26.960
Is that all?

00:31:37.020 --> 00:31:38.520
Stop standing there!

00:31:44.190 --> 00:31:45.060
Shiro!

00:31:47.820 --> 00:31:49.320
What a nuisance.

00:31:50.900 --> 00:31:52.280
Put me down!

00:31:52.280 --> 00:31:57.280
Quiet! I feel stupid enough already.

00:32:18.140 --> 00:32:21.270
Well? Can you move, Archer?

00:32:22.190 --> 00:32:24.650
It looks like the end for you.

00:32:24.650 --> 00:32:29.820
Saber's waiting outside.
I can't spend any more time on you.

00:32:30.360 --> 00:32:31.780
Fight me.

00:32:31.780 --> 00:32:32.950
I beg your pardon?

00:32:33.150 --> 00:32:35.570
You heard me! Take me on, Caster!

00:32:46.330 --> 00:32:50.420
Bones of my sword... unleash thy rage.

00:32:52.340 --> 00:32:54.550
Caladbolg!

00:33:18.950 --> 00:33:21.790
Why did you miss?

00:33:22.120 --> 00:33:27.250
I can take up my sword
only when vowing a fatal blow.

00:33:27.710 --> 00:33:29.880
To do so here is meaningless.

00:33:30.920 --> 00:33:35.050
Then the two of you are much alike.

00:33:35.470 --> 00:33:36.300
What?

00:33:36.380 --> 00:33:39.340
You don't like profitless killing.

00:33:39.390 --> 00:33:44.430
And that boy won't stand to see
innocent humans sacrificed.

00:33:44.600 --> 00:33:46.310
You're the same.

00:33:46.310 --> 00:33:49.270
Don't equate me to him!

00:33:50.060 --> 00:33:53.650
Likewise. We are of vastly different nature.

00:33:55.320 --> 00:33:58.320
It's a shame you're my enemy.

00:33:58.570 --> 00:34:00.410
Join with me.

00:34:00.580 --> 00:34:01.620
What?

00:34:03.160 --> 00:34:07.540
I can provide you with much better
than your current partner.

00:34:08.000 --> 00:34:09.880
Don't make me laugh!

00:34:09.880 --> 00:34:13.710
I refuse. Your side lacks strength.

00:34:13.710 --> 00:34:15.630
I've no reason to accept.

00:34:15.970 --> 00:34:19.220
Then we've nothing more to discuss.

00:34:19.220 --> 00:34:24.640
Correct. But since I'm the party-crasher here...

00:34:24.640 --> 00:34:26.560
I've no reason to kill you, either.

00:34:26.850 --> 00:34:28.230
You can go.

00:34:28.810 --> 00:34:30.060
Say what?

00:34:33.780 --> 00:34:34.900
Wait!

00:34:35.820 --> 00:34:37.780
Why let her escape?

00:34:37.780 --> 00:34:41.570
She's responsible for all the havoc in town!

00:34:41.570 --> 00:34:43.280
Why stop her?

00:34:44.540 --> 00:34:48.040
Caster sucked up human vitality...

00:34:48.040 --> 00:34:51.330
...for the mana to defeat Berserker.

00:34:51.580 --> 00:34:53.710
Let her do that.

00:34:54.550 --> 00:34:56.090
Then we'll defeat her.

00:34:56.090 --> 00:34:59.420
Well, I don't operate that way!

00:34:59.430 --> 00:35:02.550
I won't allow people
to be sacrificed for those ends!

00:35:03.260 --> 00:35:05.810
You can't save everybody.

00:35:08.310 --> 00:35:09.980
Just accept it.

00:35:10.100 --> 00:35:15.900
You can't save any life
unless you're willing to kill for it.

00:35:22.200 --> 00:35:24.660
I'm warning you.

00:35:30.290 --> 00:35:31.790
So be it.

00:35:37.000 --> 00:35:45.300
It ends here for you Shiro Emiya.
The boy who wouldn't fight.

00:35:54.400 --> 00:35:55.650
Shiro!

00:35:57.820 --> 00:35:59.730
Saber...

00:36:03.530 --> 00:36:05.990
Why didn't you strike me?

00:36:06.240 --> 00:36:08.370
lt would be artless...

00:36:08.370 --> 00:36:10.750
...to pluck an ephemeral flower.

00:36:11.120 --> 00:36:12.370
Go.

00:36:13.420 --> 00:36:15.790
Another time, then.

00:36:17.840 --> 00:36:20.010
Plan on interfering, samurai?

00:36:20.380 --> 00:36:25.010
I was about to ask the same of you.

00:36:49.990 --> 00:36:51.830
Release her!

00:36:59.050 --> 00:37:00.000
Fuji!

00:37:08.930 --> 00:37:10.560
You...

00:37:23.780 --> 00:37:26.660
Noble Phantasm Rule Breaker.

00:37:26.660 --> 00:37:31.410
A host of contracts nullified.
Betrayal and a wayward sword.

00:37:31.410 --> 00:37:33.250
What did you do with Saber?!

00:37:33.250 --> 00:37:35.870
Why, she's my familiar spirit now.

00:37:39.420 --> 00:37:42.630
Start by killing that girl there.

00:37:51.810 --> 00:37:54.220
No... stop.

00:37:54.390 --> 00:37:55.770
Kill her.

00:37:59.150 --> 00:38:00.520
No!

00:38:11.950 --> 00:38:14.240
You dare resist a Command Spell?

00:38:17.160 --> 00:38:19.620
Run... Shiro.

00:38:29.930 --> 00:38:31.760
Saber.

00:39:07.050 --> 00:39:08.300
Dammit.

00:39:15.220 --> 00:39:16.560
This.

00:39:19.440 --> 00:39:21.730
I remember it.

00:39:28.280 --> 00:39:31.860
Aren't you growing tired of resisting
Command Spells?

00:39:50.510 --> 00:39:55.850
Hmm. How unlucky for that girl
to have found us here.

00:40:37.350 --> 00:40:40.220
So you murdered Kirei?

00:40:43.730 --> 00:40:47.810
He didn't seem the type
to hand over the Grail willingly.

00:40:48.190 --> 00:40:49.820
ls that...

00:40:54.780 --> 00:40:57.450
...Mr. Kuzuki?

00:40:58.580 --> 00:41:01.950
Did you check to see he was dead?

00:41:02.160 --> 00:41:04.080
Why do you ask that?

00:41:04.830 --> 00:41:07.710
Because I doubt he'd die so easily.

00:41:07.710 --> 00:41:11.000
You're quite the pathetic woman.

00:41:11.260 --> 00:41:15.090
Go rescue Saber. I'll handle the witch.

00:41:15.550 --> 00:41:19.470
You understand that your sorcery's
no match for Caster.

00:41:20.510 --> 00:41:21.930
I will defeat her.

00:41:23.390 --> 00:41:25.270
Nice sentiment.

00:41:25.270 --> 00:41:29.060
But stopping Caster in this place won't be easy.

00:41:29.060 --> 00:41:33.190
After all, she killed her own brother
to save herself.

00:41:33.780 --> 00:41:35.610
Why tell me this?

00:41:35.610 --> 00:41:40.870
It is said the dragon's tooth resides in
the King of Colchis' magic.

00:41:40.870 --> 00:41:45.500
His daughter, Queen Medea,
was considered a grand witch.

00:41:46.040 --> 00:41:47.420
Correct.

00:41:47.790 --> 00:41:50.960
Hence my advantage in this place.

00:41:51.750 --> 00:41:55.470
Saber will soon fall completely under my will.

00:41:58.510 --> 00:42:01.510
You can't break Saber
even with a Command Spell.

00:42:01.810 --> 00:42:04.180
If only a heartbeat...

00:42:04.480 --> 00:42:06.600
I'll have ample time to kill you.

00:42:06.600 --> 00:42:08.020
Impossible.

00:42:08.690 --> 00:42:11.400
I accept your earlier offer.

00:42:12.230 --> 00:42:15.740
After declining once? How fickle you are.

00:42:15.860 --> 00:42:21.530
Things have changed.
With Saber, victory leans your way.

00:42:21.530 --> 00:42:23.410
What're you saying, Archer?

00:42:23.410 --> 00:42:25.790
Use the contract breaker.

00:42:51.560 --> 00:42:52.730
Shiro!

00:43:01.700 --> 00:43:03.030
Trace on!

00:43:17.460 --> 00:43:18.420
Wait.

00:43:18.760 --> 00:43:22.140
I've one condition before joining you.

00:43:22.140 --> 00:43:24.550
Condition? What now?

00:43:25.060 --> 00:43:27.560
Allow them to escape this time.

00:43:27.730 --> 00:43:32.650
They're hardly Magi now.
Killing them holds no value.

00:43:35.230 --> 00:43:39.820
Fine. Go quickly in defeat.

00:43:42.110 --> 00:43:43.660
Let's go.

00:43:53.580 --> 00:43:55.960
For what it's worth...

00:43:57.170 --> 00:44:00.010
I made a mistake.

00:44:00.010 --> 00:44:04.720
I should've defeated Caster earlier,
regardless of the means.

00:44:05.970 --> 00:44:10.100
I can't fully blame Archer for switching sides.

00:44:11.640 --> 00:44:14.900
That's where I went wrong.

00:44:15.400 --> 00:44:17.440
No you didn't.

00:44:18.980 --> 00:44:23.070
You may have failed. But you weren't wrong.

00:44:24.620 --> 00:44:26.780
So lift your head high.

00:44:31.410 --> 00:44:33.160
Shiro.

00:44:36.710 --> 00:44:40.380
You sure surprised me.

00:44:40.920 --> 00:44:44.430
You projected the same swords as Archer.

00:44:44.430 --> 00:44:46.720
It surprised me, too.

00:44:46.720 --> 00:44:51.600
I'd never projected a weapon before.
But his swords were different.

00:44:52.310 --> 00:44:57.610
I skipped over all the thought processes,
and saw a clear image.

00:44:58.070 --> 00:45:01.110
As if it had been there all along.

00:45:08.240 --> 00:45:11.410
We'll need a new game plan.

00:45:13.040 --> 00:45:15.670
Oh yeah. I need to return this.

00:45:23.920 --> 00:45:25.380
Yours, right?

00:45:25.470 --> 00:45:29.850
I didn't realize until I saw one
with the same shape in your home.

00:45:42.820 --> 00:45:46.200
Maybe we can get Illyasviel to help us.

00:45:46.200 --> 00:45:48.990
What, are you nuts?

00:45:48.990 --> 00:45:52.950
The Master of Berserker
would never ally with another.

00:45:53.200 --> 00:45:57.670
We won't know until we try. There's a chance.

00:45:57.670 --> 00:46:01.540
Forget it. You're way too trusting.

00:46:02.050 --> 00:46:07.720
Archer might label clinging
to a tiny hope as sheer stupidity.

00:46:07.800 --> 00:46:10.090
But we're different.

00:46:10.180 --> 00:46:14.390
We can find hope in death-defying odds.

00:46:35.620 --> 00:46:37.160
Berserker.

00:46:42.800 --> 00:46:44.460
What's going on here?

00:47:02.900 --> 00:47:04.320
Berserker!

00:47:07.780 --> 00:47:09.530
Chains of Heaven!

00:47:20.120 --> 00:47:22.880
Once you're bound in these chains...

00:47:22.880 --> 00:47:26.090
...not even the gods themselves could escape!

00:47:49.490 --> 00:47:50.900
Berserker!

00:48:11.590 --> 00:48:13.010
Come little doll.

00:48:13.010 --> 00:48:18.430
No! I don't want to!

00:48:34.320 --> 00:48:36.450
No!!

00:48:48.170 --> 00:48:49.460
Emiya?

00:48:50.130 --> 00:48:52.210
A spectator?

00:48:52.220 --> 00:48:55.510
I know I'm quite a sight to watch.

00:48:55.510 --> 00:48:58.010
But you should know your place!

00:49:00.100 --> 00:49:01.470
Wait.

00:49:03.390 --> 00:49:08.610
How do you like my new Servant?

00:49:10.110 --> 00:49:12.490
Beg for your life.

00:49:13.070 --> 00:49:17.030
Maybe he'll spare you that at least.

00:49:18.450 --> 00:49:19.910
No way!

00:49:22.870 --> 00:49:24.710
You! Servant!

00:49:25.790 --> 00:49:28.920
Move one finger and your Magus dies!

00:49:28.960 --> 00:49:30.420
Tosaka!

00:49:30.630 --> 00:49:36.300
You realize killing my Magus
won't stop me, don't you girl?

00:49:38.640 --> 00:49:40.430
What're you doing?

00:49:40.680 --> 00:49:46.230
Conditions have changed.
She'd make a good vessel.

00:49:50.020 --> 00:49:52.570
Good to see you, Tosaka.

00:49:52.570 --> 00:49:54.900
Glad you're still alive.

00:49:54.900 --> 00:49:58.200
I'm sure you know Caster's building strength.

00:49:58.200 --> 00:50:01.530
Ryudo Temple is to be the next altar.

00:50:01.700 --> 00:50:05.200
Can't afford to lose any territory.

00:50:05.370 --> 00:50:08.960
Why not forget about Emiya...

00:50:08.960 --> 00:50:10.790
and join with us?

00:50:10.790 --> 00:50:12.340
No thanks!

00:50:13.050 --> 00:50:17.220
Join up to take orders from you? Don't be stupid.

00:50:20.140 --> 00:50:21.800
For your information...

00:50:21.810 --> 00:50:25.850
There's only one person who thinks
you have the talent to be a Magus.

00:50:25.930 --> 00:50:27.890
And that's you.

00:50:28.480 --> 00:50:32.690
Time's up. Can't let this heart spoil.

00:50:33.070 --> 00:50:33.940
Wait!

00:50:34.440 --> 00:50:36.990
Dammit! You'll be sorry!

00:50:53.800 --> 00:50:55.340
Why'd you do it?

00:50:56.420 --> 00:51:00.760
You knew you'd be killed appearing before him.

00:51:00.760 --> 00:51:03.430
Why'd you run out?

00:51:05.810 --> 00:51:07.680
No reason.

00:51:08.350 --> 00:51:10.940
I wanted to save her.

00:51:10.940 --> 00:51:15.230
You confirmed the suspicions I had of you.

00:51:16.440 --> 00:51:19.650
Your ideas are warped.

00:51:19.650 --> 00:51:23.990
You value other people's lives
far above your own.

00:51:23.990 --> 00:51:27.120
But you need to put yourself first.

00:51:27.120 --> 00:51:31.120
You're always weighing down the scale
with the welfare of others.

00:51:31.120 --> 00:51:33.500
But you are the scale!

00:51:34.290 --> 00:51:39.880
And you're willing to destroy it
to save someone else.

00:51:39.930 --> 00:51:41.340
Tosaka?

00:51:42.180 --> 00:51:46.600
It's fine if you were just an
aimless person just simply living.

00:51:46.600 --> 00:51:49.770
But you have a sense of self!

00:51:49.890 --> 00:51:54.190
For one with so much conviction,
you sure are careless.

00:51:54.190 --> 00:51:57.980
Keep that up and you'll surely break apart.

00:51:58.610 --> 00:52:02.610
I do what I do so that I won't break apart.

00:52:02.780 --> 00:52:06.370
No. You're already broken.

00:52:06.660 --> 00:52:10.700
I don't know what happened. But tell me.

00:52:10.710 --> 00:52:14.210
What is it that made you so crazy?

00:52:14.630 --> 00:52:17.130
Back at school...

00:52:17.800 --> 00:52:22.630
all those bodies didn't faze you.
You even said so yourself.

00:52:22.840 --> 00:52:27.050
You've seen as much before.

00:52:27.890 --> 00:52:29.720
It's true.

00:52:31.690 --> 00:52:34.400
It wasn't the first time for me.

00:52:34.400 --> 00:52:36.980
But you're wrong.

00:52:37.190 --> 00:52:40.150
That fire ten years ago saved me.

00:52:40.150 --> 00:52:43.650
It's not to blame for whatever you think it did.

00:52:44.740 --> 00:52:48.580
I was saved, and that's all.

00:52:49.160 --> 00:52:50.620
How so?

00:53:02.760 --> 00:53:05.510
I had accepted death.

00:53:06.140 --> 00:53:08.510
I expected it.

00:53:08.600 --> 00:53:12.470
In that condition,
my body may have been saved.

00:53:12.560 --> 00:53:15.230
But my spirit couldn't return.

00:53:15.310 --> 00:53:18.230
In my emptiness...

00:53:18.320 --> 00:53:21.780
I wondered if there was
something noble to live for.

00:53:25.070 --> 00:53:29.030
I was the only survivor, you see.

00:53:30.240 --> 00:53:33.000
In exchange for all who had died...

00:53:33.080 --> 00:53:36.750
I must spend my life helping people.

00:53:38.130 --> 00:53:41.250
All the more reason to value your own life!

00:53:41.250 --> 00:53:43.340
If fortune spared just you...

00:53:43.340 --> 00:53:46.180
you must respect that gift!

00:53:46.340 --> 00:53:51.560
You have to heal all that pain
with your happiness!

00:53:57.400 --> 00:54:00.690
Thank you; you're right, Tosaka.

00:54:00.690 --> 00:54:04.990
I know I've made mistakes. That's okay.

00:54:05.610 --> 00:54:11.990
But wanting to live for others...
I know that's not wrong.

00:54:19.330 --> 00:54:22.380
There's not supposed to be an eighth Servant.

00:54:22.380 --> 00:54:25.420
He's obviously not one
of the chosen for this war.

00:54:25.420 --> 00:54:28.510
And why partner with Shinji?

00:54:28.510 --> 00:54:33.600
We must first focus on Caster.
She builds mana as we wait.

00:54:35.350 --> 00:54:37.020
You're right.

00:54:38.100 --> 00:54:41.190
You two will never win alone!

00:54:48.990 --> 00:54:50.160
Lancer!

00:54:50.370 --> 00:54:52.240
Wait. I'm not here to fight.

00:54:52.240 --> 00:54:53.490
What?

00:54:53.950 --> 00:54:56.950
You could use my help.

00:54:56.960 --> 00:55:01.080
Help? ls this your idea or...

00:55:01.080 --> 00:55:03.090
Orders from my Magus.

00:55:03.090 --> 00:55:07.880
Caster grows stronger. My Magus seeks allies.

00:55:07.880 --> 00:55:12.470
Consider it a temporary alliance
to end once the job is done.

00:55:18.350 --> 00:55:21.730
I'm in. How about you?

00:55:22.900 --> 00:55:25.610
You expect us to trust you just like that?

00:55:25.610 --> 00:55:29.900
l do. You have a fine woman as co-conspirator.

00:55:29.900 --> 00:55:32.450
A fine woman helping you.

00:55:32.490 --> 00:55:35.780
And you like to give people
the benefit of the doubt.

00:55:42.420 --> 00:55:47.170
I should tell you about the pendant you gave me.

00:55:47.510 --> 00:55:49.880
There's only one.

00:55:50.510 --> 00:55:56.060
What you found in my room
is a pendant Archer returned to me.

00:55:56.390 --> 00:56:01.350
I thought he had just picked it up somewhere.

00:56:17.870 --> 00:56:20.830
I was sure you'd come back.

00:56:24.790 --> 00:56:29.000
You'll have to fight me first.

00:56:30.800 --> 00:56:35.180
Didn't take you long to find a new Servant.

00:56:35.970 --> 00:56:37.350
Go on ahead.

00:57:26.480 --> 00:57:27.860
Tell me...

00:57:27.860 --> 00:57:30.360
you really an archer?

00:57:32.320 --> 00:57:35.030
You're good but...

00:57:36.530 --> 00:57:38.200
But your swordsmanship.

00:57:38.320 --> 00:57:41.990
It lacks pride.

00:57:43.330 --> 00:57:46.580
Sorry to disappoint you. I don't have pride.

00:57:59.300 --> 00:58:02.060
Gae Bolg!

00:58:02.220 --> 00:58:03.970
Ro! Aias!

00:58:14.530 --> 00:58:16.150
Impressive.

00:58:16.450 --> 00:58:20.740
A spear that can pierce Aias.

00:58:21.700 --> 00:58:24.160
What are you really?

00:58:24.330 --> 00:58:26.080
Just an archer.

00:58:26.080 --> 00:58:27.460
Liar!

00:58:27.620 --> 00:58:30.880
With a shield that can block a Noble Phantasm?

00:58:31.130 --> 00:58:33.550
Notice anything?

00:58:36.300 --> 00:58:39.930
Caster appears to be in trouble.

00:58:46.310 --> 00:58:49.140
So this was your plan all along.

00:59:42.200 --> 00:59:43.820
Trace on!

01:00:01.880 --> 01:00:06.010
Dearest Soichiro.

01:00:07.220 --> 01:00:08.850
Caster...

01:00:35.630 --> 01:00:39.760
Archer, I kind of suspected...

01:00:39.760 --> 01:00:42.010
...but you didn't defect.

01:00:44.840 --> 01:00:46.090
Saber!

01:00:49.890 --> 01:00:51.220
Saber.

01:00:54.020 --> 01:00:55.940
Shiro.

01:00:59.980 --> 01:01:01.280
I missed.

01:01:03.910 --> 01:01:05.700
What's that for?

01:01:11.500 --> 01:01:15.420
I'm acting on my own now.

01:01:15.920 --> 01:01:18.130
Still plan on killing Shiro?

01:01:20.510 --> 01:01:22.340
Back off, Archer.

01:01:22.420 --> 01:01:25.880
If you fight in your condition, Saber,
you might vanish.

01:01:26.090 --> 01:01:29.470
I vowed to serve as his sword. I'd protect him.

01:01:30.560 --> 01:01:34.230
Then you will disappear!

01:01:56.830 --> 01:01:58.250
Trace on.

01:01:59.710 --> 01:02:02.550
That magic is too powerful for you.

01:02:02.920 --> 01:02:06.800
The bill that has kept you alive thus far...

01:02:06.800 --> 01:02:09.510
...gets paid in full now.

01:02:18.810 --> 01:02:20.610
There's your limit.

01:02:20.940 --> 01:02:22.190
Hear thee!

01:02:23.110 --> 01:02:27.030
I command thee to my side.
Entrust my fate in thy sword.

01:02:27.200 --> 01:02:29.070
Heeding to Holy Grail's refuge

01:02:29.160 --> 01:02:31.990
If thou surrender to this will and reason...
Answer my call.

01:02:32.370 --> 01:02:36.000
I embody Virtue in the Eternal World.

01:02:36.080 --> 01:02:38.460
I chastise Evil in the Eternal World.

01:02:38.540 --> 01:02:42.710
Thou art the Seven Heavens
harboring the great spirit trinity.

01:02:42.800 --> 01:02:44.760
Come forth O Keeper of Balance!

01:02:44.840 --> 01:02:46.170
Obey me!

01:02:46.260 --> 01:02:49.380
And I will entrust this fate in your sword!

01:02:57.060 --> 01:02:59.940
In the name of Saber, I accept the pledge.

01:03:00.560 --> 01:03:03.820
I acknowledge you as my Magus... Rin!

01:03:20.750 --> 01:03:24.040
Do you really think you can beat me now?

01:03:36.100 --> 01:03:39.560
You used your Noble Phantasm.
Your mana is depleted.

01:03:39.730 --> 01:03:42.810
Without even a Magus, what can you do?

01:03:44.190 --> 01:03:48.320
An archer can exist for two days
without a master.

01:03:48.650 --> 01:03:51.320
Plenty of time to kill him.

01:03:51.450 --> 01:03:54.780
Why? Why pursue that conclusion?

01:03:55.410 --> 01:04:00.410
What you seek is wrong.
It is futile for you to persist.

01:04:00.460 --> 01:04:03.830
You yourself cling to a mistaken goal.

01:04:14.050 --> 01:04:15.180
Stop!

01:04:51.170 --> 01:04:55.430
We're in his mindscape... a world of his making.

01:04:55.510 --> 01:04:58.350
A Reality Marble.

01:04:58.510 --> 01:05:01.140
This is a world only I can possess.

01:05:01.850 --> 01:05:06.150
Here, I can replicate weapons at will.

01:05:06.560 --> 01:05:09.400
That is my talent as an Epic Spirit.

01:05:09.650 --> 01:05:12.900
Your world, you say?

01:05:13.400 --> 01:05:19.450
I'll show you by duplicating your holy sword.

01:05:19.540 --> 01:05:21.410
You know not its true form.

01:05:21.790 --> 01:05:26.920
I don't have to. But I can come real close.

01:05:45.980 --> 01:05:47.310
Shiro, no!

01:06:02.410 --> 01:06:06.250
Is that all you got?

01:06:23.430 --> 01:06:25.560
What're you doing?

01:06:25.770 --> 01:06:28.980
Unhand me, you fool!

01:06:35.360 --> 01:06:36.700
Where you going?

01:06:36.950 --> 01:06:39.660
Where we won't be bothered.

01:06:39.950 --> 01:06:41.950
What about Rin?

01:06:41.950 --> 01:06:43.660
An exchange.

01:06:44.370 --> 01:06:47.120
That boy will have to pursue me.

01:06:47.330 --> 01:06:50.080
What's more... Rin's your master.

01:06:50.880 --> 01:06:56.010
Protect him if you will.
But it won't replace your master's life.

01:06:58.260 --> 01:07:02.100
He's going to Einzbern Castle.

01:07:02.350 --> 01:07:04.970
No one will bother us there.

01:07:04.970 --> 01:07:06.270
Shiro.

01:07:06.980 --> 01:07:09.810
We'll hear your complaints.

01:07:09.810 --> 01:07:13.940
But if you lay a finger on Tosaka...

01:07:13.940 --> 01:07:18.900
I will kill you, Saber or no!

01:07:31.830 --> 01:07:33.960
Is it finished, Boy?

01:07:36.130 --> 01:07:37.010
Lancer!

01:07:37.010 --> 01:07:41.050
Wait! He came to our aid.

01:07:42.720 --> 01:07:45.260
Where's the girl?

01:07:47.480 --> 01:07:49.310
Archer took her.

01:07:49.310 --> 01:07:50.520
Say what?

01:08:01.910 --> 01:08:03.360
Archer!

01:08:04.120 --> 01:08:07.330
You insist on killing Shiro?

01:08:07.330 --> 01:08:12.040
The sooner the better for a softie like him.

01:08:14.290 --> 01:08:17.380
A softie he may be...

01:08:17.380 --> 01:08:21.970
But that's his strength.

01:08:22.430 --> 01:08:25.350
He has to be that way.

01:08:25.350 --> 01:08:29.520
By accepting him, I feel somehow saved.

01:08:35.650 --> 01:08:37.980
Well, Tosaka!

01:08:38.150 --> 01:08:39.400
Shinji!

01:08:42.320 --> 01:08:44.070
What's wrong, Archer?

01:08:44.870 --> 01:08:47.490
Trembling at my Gilgamesh?

01:08:47.740 --> 01:08:49.290
You want Rin?

01:08:49.290 --> 01:08:54.120
Why else would anyone visit this moldy castle?

01:08:54.130 --> 01:08:57.750
Then wait till I dispose of Shiro Emiya.

01:08:58.170 --> 01:09:00.960
After that, she's all yours.

01:09:01.470 --> 01:09:03.260
If you don't like it, tough.

01:09:05.340 --> 01:09:07.510
What a quaint little clown. Move.

01:09:09.220 --> 01:09:13.980
Take it easy. Archer will vanish soon, anyway.

01:09:14.150 --> 01:09:16.100
Hmph, the fake.

01:09:30.450 --> 01:09:32.120
You're late.

01:09:32.450 --> 01:09:34.040
Where's Tosaka?!

01:09:34.210 --> 01:09:39.290
You took so long, l gave her away to Shinji.

01:09:39.550 --> 01:09:41.090
Easy.

01:09:41.210 --> 01:09:46.050
My Master's ordered me not to let her die.

01:09:56.770 --> 01:09:59.810
We had the exact same pendant.

01:10:02.440 --> 01:10:06.820
But there was originally only one.

01:10:07.450 --> 01:10:12.330
I believe you've carried it
since your life was spared.

01:10:13.250 --> 01:10:17.080
An heirloom of Tosaka's father.

01:10:18.380 --> 01:10:21.750
So now I know your identity.

01:10:23.550 --> 01:10:25.670
Epic Spirit Emiya.

01:10:26.300 --> 01:10:28.890
That's your real name.

01:10:29.680 --> 01:10:34.640
Shouldn't you embody
Shiro's ideal of Man turned Hero?

01:10:34.930 --> 01:10:38.350
Then why seek to kill yourself?

01:10:38.770 --> 01:10:42.940
I did become the Epic Spirit you idealized.

01:10:43.030 --> 01:10:47.610
I rescued people... even saved the world once.

01:10:52.410 --> 01:10:57.830
But all I was left with afterwards was regret.

01:10:58.580 --> 01:11:01.460
And ghosts of the dead.

01:11:01.750 --> 01:11:04.380
Ghosts?

01:11:04.670 --> 01:11:07.880
To save as many humans as possible...

01:11:07.880 --> 01:11:11.140
I killed, killed and killed again.

01:11:11.760 --> 01:11:13.930
I slaughtered to fulfill my destiny.

01:11:14.010 --> 01:11:19.770
And though I saved many times
more people than I killed...

01:11:20.190 --> 01:11:24.230
I can't even begin to count the dead.

01:11:24.230 --> 01:11:29.700
I can never exit this circle.

01:11:30.240 --> 01:11:34.030
But for one exception.

01:11:34.160 --> 01:11:37.540
You regret everything?

01:11:37.750 --> 01:11:40.370
Of course...

01:11:40.460 --> 01:11:43.920
ln fact, you weren't
supposed to be an Epic Spirit.

01:11:44.130 --> 01:11:48.840
That makes us different. I have no regrets!

01:11:48.920 --> 01:11:51.680
I feel no sympathy for you!

01:11:51.680 --> 01:11:54.800
By my own hand, I'll relieve you
of your corrupted principles!

01:11:55.180 --> 01:11:57.100
Then you know.

01:11:57.770 --> 01:12:01.980
Fighting me means a battle for the blade works!

01:12:17.700 --> 01:12:19.330
Trace on.

01:12:30.510 --> 01:12:31.720
Shinji!

01:12:36.560 --> 01:12:37.760
Lancer!

01:12:38.100 --> 01:12:39.560
Keep still.

01:12:40.230 --> 01:12:42.230
That's far enough, Lancer.

01:12:42.640 --> 01:12:43.730
What?

01:12:47.730 --> 01:12:50.690
Kirei! You're alive!

01:12:50.740 --> 01:12:54.950
You break your pledge
by showing yourself, Master.

01:12:54.950 --> 01:12:57.370
You disobeyed, too.

01:12:57.740 --> 01:13:00.870
I told you to take care of Archer.

01:13:01.410 --> 01:13:03.830
Don't worry. He'll self-destruct.

01:13:03.830 --> 01:13:08.000
But that boy... is he your tool?

01:13:08.170 --> 01:13:10.550
Don't second guess me.

01:13:10.550 --> 01:13:17.600
To acquire the Grail, I formed
an alliance with them.

01:13:17.600 --> 01:13:19.100
Charlatan priest!

01:13:19.100 --> 01:13:23.640
So you lied about wanting
to save your pupil. What now?

01:13:23.640 --> 01:13:27.190
No, she served a valuable purpose.

01:13:27.270 --> 01:13:36.610
So I gave her protection. That was paternal
enough. But I refuse to retire so easily.

01:13:37.530 --> 01:13:39.160
Finish her.

01:13:40.330 --> 01:13:43.790
If you wanted me to do it,
you could've used a Command Spell.

01:13:44.000 --> 01:13:47.710
Then I order you now. Kill thyself, Lancer.

01:13:57.550 --> 01:13:59.010
Lancer!

01:14:01.060 --> 01:14:05.560
Damn you, Kotomine!

01:14:16.070 --> 01:14:19.570
Rin, you must go, too.

01:14:38.510 --> 01:14:40.340
Lancer, you...!

01:14:40.640 --> 01:14:43.810
If l knew I'd die like this...

01:14:44.020 --> 01:14:47.890
I wouldn't have become a hero!

01:15:12.000 --> 01:15:14.880
Fools! Kill each other for all I care!

01:15:14.880 --> 01:15:17.720
The Grail is yours, my ass!

01:15:28.890 --> 01:15:31.940
Now the Grail...

01:15:35.980 --> 01:15:37.860
...is all mine!

01:15:37.860 --> 01:15:41.450
I'll share it with you if you're nice.

01:15:41.450 --> 01:15:42.160
Stop!

01:15:42.160 --> 01:15:44.620
Start pleading, Tosaka.

01:15:46.370 --> 01:15:50.160
Don't you touch her.

01:15:50.620 --> 01:15:52.380
Why aren't you dead?

01:15:52.380 --> 01:15:54.710
Buzz off!

01:16:05.890 --> 01:16:06.810
Lancer!

01:16:12.560 --> 01:16:14.650
We must treat that wound!

01:16:14.820 --> 01:16:18.820
A heart burst by Gae Bolg won't heal.

01:16:30.710 --> 01:16:32.210
Go.

01:16:42.090 --> 01:16:44.510
Farewell, Lancer.

01:16:44.890 --> 01:16:49.850
I didn't know you long.
But I'd say you were my type.

01:16:50.560 --> 01:16:52.730
Sorry, lassie.

01:16:53.560 --> 01:16:57.190
Come back when you're older.

01:17:19.710 --> 01:17:24.380
You think your swordsmanship is equal to mine?

01:17:25.720 --> 01:17:28.890
You're still too green in the bones!

01:17:28.890 --> 01:17:30.680
Enough!

01:17:37.020 --> 01:17:38.360
"I am...

01:17:38.360 --> 01:17:40.110
"I am...
the bone of my sword."

01:17:42.150 --> 01:17:43.650
"Steel is my body."

01:17:43.650 --> 01:17:45.610
"Steel is my body."
"And fire is my blood."

01:17:47.950 --> 01:17:50.910
"I fought over a thousand battles."

01:17:50.910 --> 01:17:53.910
"I fought over a thousand battles."
"Never knowing loss."

01:17:53.910 --> 01:17:56.620
"I fought over a thousand battles."
"Never knowing loss."
"But never understood."

01:17:58.920 --> 01:18:00.920
"Always fighting alone."

01:18:00.920 --> 01:18:02.460
"Always fighting alone."
"Poised atop a battlefield"

01:18:02.460 --> 01:18:04.510
"Always fighting alone."
"Poised atop a battlefield"
"Drunk on victory."

01:18:07.590 --> 01:18:10.850
"Ultimately, my life has no meaning."

01:18:10.850 --> 01:18:12.640
"Ultimately, my life has no meaning."
"My whole body was....

01:18:13.390 --> 01:18:15.980
...Unlimited Blade Works."

01:18:18.690 --> 01:18:23.530
So now you see the future that awaits you.

01:18:24.320 --> 01:18:28.450
A lost creature imprisoned by futile ideals.

01:18:28.450 --> 01:18:31.530
Do you now understand your true self?

01:18:37.420 --> 01:18:40.880
Why you...!

01:18:44.420 --> 01:18:46.840
Do you really seek to be a hero?

01:18:47.130 --> 01:18:50.800
Not "seek to be." Will be!

01:18:50.800 --> 01:18:52.350
Well of course!

01:18:52.350 --> 01:18:56.430
That's all you have!

01:18:56.640 --> 01:18:57.940
Quiet!

01:18:58.190 --> 01:19:00.690
A longing!

01:19:01.940 --> 01:19:06.860
The joy on the face of the man who saved you.

01:19:06.990 --> 01:19:09.490
That's what you wish for!

01:19:09.490 --> 01:19:11.950
Your ideals are not even your own!

01:19:11.950 --> 01:19:13.280
No!

01:19:16.500 --> 01:19:21.960
You've been ruled by an obsession
that you must help people!

01:19:22.090 --> 01:19:25.550
It's become a pipe dream.
You just haven't noticed!

01:19:26.590 --> 01:19:30.090
You're living in a fairy tale.

01:19:30.840 --> 01:19:35.470
If you can't live without that, then die dreaming!

01:19:42.810 --> 01:19:44.770
My whole body was...

01:19:44.780 --> 01:19:47.150
My whole body was unlimited blade works.

01:19:47.440 --> 01:19:49.240
Still you persist.

01:19:49.990 --> 01:19:51.740
I won't let you beat me.

01:19:52.030 --> 01:19:54.620
I may lose to others...

01:19:54.950 --> 01:19:57.370
...but I won't lose to myself!

01:19:58.250 --> 01:19:59.540
You...

01:20:03.130 --> 01:20:04.710
I'm right!

01:20:07.460 --> 01:20:11.840
You're too stupid to accept
that you're outmatched.

01:20:12.260 --> 01:20:14.430
I'm not mistaken! Justice is on my side!

01:20:27.570 --> 01:20:30.110
That was my mistake, too!

01:20:30.320 --> 01:20:33.360
Well, it won't be mine!

01:20:41.290 --> 01:20:45.670
Archer!

01:21:01.690 --> 01:21:04.350
My victory, Archer.

01:21:05.690 --> 01:21:10.610
Yeah... and my loss.

01:21:18.700 --> 01:21:22.870
No matter what obstacles lie ahead,
I'll have no regrets.

01:21:22.870 --> 01:21:24.620
I'll overcome them!

01:21:25.170 --> 01:21:29.420
That you must. Or it's all a lie.

01:21:31.460 --> 01:21:33.550
Pretty entertaining.

01:21:33.840 --> 01:21:37.890
Two like-minded imitations
locked in a pathetic battle.

01:21:54.070 --> 01:21:58.070
Now you see what real strength feels like.

01:21:58.280 --> 01:22:01.120
Imitations belong in the trash.

01:22:09.040 --> 01:22:10.170
Archer!

01:22:10.920 --> 01:22:14.550
You can beat him. l know you can.

01:22:25.190 --> 01:22:28.270
How dare you take my Archer!

01:22:32.400 --> 01:22:33.320
Stand back!

01:22:47.750 --> 01:22:50.080
l'll get soiled by dust.

01:22:50.290 --> 01:22:52.800
You got lucky, maggots.

01:22:53.420 --> 01:22:54.670
Running away?

01:22:54.670 --> 01:22:58.010
I must quickly complete the Grail.

01:22:58.010 --> 01:23:04.430
If l lose my master and the Grail bubbles over,
who knows what it may do?

01:23:12.070 --> 01:23:15.530
He plans to complete the Grail at Ryudo Temple.

01:23:15.530 --> 01:23:16.990
So we attack?

01:23:16.990 --> 01:23:21.870
You hold Gilgamesh at the gate.
Shiro and I will enter from the rear.

01:23:22.080 --> 01:23:25.200
No, Saber's at a disadvantage against him.

01:23:26.120 --> 01:23:27.580
How so?

01:23:27.580 --> 01:23:30.370
His powers are too destructive.

01:23:30.580 --> 01:23:33.380
He needs a foe with the same type of power.

01:23:33.460 --> 01:23:35.340
Then who?

01:23:38.170 --> 01:23:40.430
The same type of power?

01:23:40.510 --> 01:23:41.590
His foe must be...

01:23:41.680 --> 01:23:43.720
You, right?

01:23:44.560 --> 01:23:49.060
Your only hope is to use Archer's Reality Marble.

01:23:49.270 --> 01:23:52.810
That requires immense magic.

01:23:52.940 --> 01:23:58.070
A good sorcerer knows how
to borrow from elsewhere.

01:24:01.700 --> 01:24:03.950
What I mean is...

01:24:05.370 --> 01:24:07.040
Um...

01:24:18.090 --> 01:24:22.010
Can't be helped. You'll have to do.

01:24:32.600 --> 01:24:35.650
You wanted the Grail, right?

01:24:41.030 --> 01:24:43.200
It's very, very valuable.

01:24:45.700 --> 01:24:48.290
Don't let it go.

01:24:58.760 --> 01:25:03.590
Transplant Rin's spell marks to me?
ls that possible?

01:25:03.800 --> 01:25:06.100
What other option is there?

01:25:06.100 --> 01:25:12.350
If it works, I can feed you the power
to form a Reality Marble.

01:25:12.810 --> 01:25:15.850
Focus your energy and let's begin.

01:25:20.990 --> 01:25:25.070
Hiyoku... rise. Control these marks.

01:25:25.160 --> 01:25:28.240
No. 1, No. 16, stop.

01:25:28.330 --> 01:25:29.790
Engrave thy covenant.

01:25:29.870 --> 01:25:35.210
1,2,3,4,5,6...

01:25:35.540 --> 01:25:41.130
Innumerable, smaller, larger, larger, smaller...

01:25:41.210 --> 01:25:43.840
Hiyoku... form!

01:26:30.010 --> 01:26:32.140
Did it work?

01:26:33.560 --> 01:26:35.850
Now it's all up to you.

01:26:35.980 --> 01:26:38.980
Okay. Thank you, Tosaka.

01:26:39.560 --> 01:26:40.650
Tosaka? What's wrong?

01:26:42.690 --> 01:26:46.780
My memories... you saw them.

01:26:47.910 --> 01:26:49.740
I... well...

01:26:51.200 --> 01:26:53.790
You jerk!

01:27:20.020 --> 01:27:22.230
I waited for you, Saber.

01:27:23.270 --> 01:27:24.230
Assassin.

01:27:25.280 --> 01:27:27.740
Caster has disappeared.

01:27:28.360 --> 01:27:30.910
How can you still retain that form?

01:27:31.530 --> 01:27:33.870
She may be a sorceress...

01:27:33.870 --> 01:27:37.960
But a Servant has no control
over another Servant.

01:27:38.620 --> 01:27:43.960
She summoned me and
chose this place for my dwelling.

01:27:44.250 --> 01:27:48.760
I must remain here to defend this gate.

01:27:55.850 --> 01:27:58.230
I shall not see the daybreak.

01:27:58.230 --> 01:28:02.270
But I am thankful for this final opportunity.

01:28:04.730 --> 01:28:07.650
You mean, to fight me.

01:28:08.700 --> 01:28:11.240
This body must fall like petals.

01:28:11.410 --> 01:28:17.540
If I can greet this end with you,
I'll have no better grave.

01:28:26.460 --> 01:28:27.840
What is that?

01:28:31.470 --> 01:28:34.340
Is that the Grail?

01:28:35.220 --> 01:28:37.970
Not in its true form.

01:28:37.970 --> 01:28:39.100
But it's about to burst.

01:28:45.770 --> 01:28:48.610
Must I see your ugly faces again?

01:28:48.990 --> 01:28:50.400
Gilgamesh!

01:28:50.400 --> 01:28:51.700
Can't be.

01:28:52.360 --> 01:28:55.030
Who's Saber fighting, then?

01:28:58.330 --> 01:29:01.000
That cocoon hatches.

01:29:04.250 --> 01:29:08.750
I think the Grail would like
a bigger audience for its birth.

01:29:09.300 --> 01:29:13.630
Perhaps your lives will have meaning after all.

01:29:13.720 --> 01:29:16.140
You can help bring it into the world.

01:29:16.300 --> 01:29:19.510
Is that so? Well, I've got bad news!

01:29:19.520 --> 01:29:22.100
We're spoiling this birthday party!

01:29:22.600 --> 01:29:25.690
Woman, who gave you permission?

01:29:26.190 --> 01:29:27.400
Trace on!

01:29:34.660 --> 01:29:35.950
You...

01:30:05.850 --> 01:30:08.980
Come on! Try to keep up!

01:30:18.620 --> 01:30:20.450
Divine Experience.

01:30:21.990 --> 01:30:23.950
Blade work complete.

01:30:26.250 --> 01:30:28.540
Full projection stand-by!

01:30:29.880 --> 01:30:35.300
Oh? So you can replicate my
Noble Phantasms on sight, huh?

01:30:35.380 --> 01:30:37.380
Well, then allow me to...

01:30:39.140 --> 01:30:40.640
Cease and melt!

01:30:40.640 --> 01:30:42.010
...give you a grade!

01:30:43.220 --> 01:30:46.310
Full Projection Sword Barrel!

01:31:03.370 --> 01:31:04.490
Hiken!

01:31:08.830 --> 01:31:10.540
Tsubame-gaeshi!

01:31:24.640 --> 01:31:25.720
Go.

01:31:35.320 --> 01:31:38.200
A beautiful little bird...

01:31:38.570 --> 01:31:42.740
that fights like a lion.

01:31:46.200 --> 01:31:50.670
I would've been better matched by Archer.

01:31:51.000 --> 01:31:55.050
At least he didn't live by borrowed principles.

01:31:55.420 --> 01:31:59.590
That's what he said about you, wasn't it?

01:31:59.590 --> 01:32:01.840
Yes, he did.

01:32:03.550 --> 01:32:06.180
Beyond the dream lies disillusionment, he said.

01:32:06.270 --> 01:32:11.350
And yet he pursued it,
anyway with relentless abandon.

01:32:12.190 --> 01:32:15.150
As someone with unattainable ideals...

01:32:15.230 --> 01:32:17.730
I admire that noble devotion!

01:32:20.700 --> 01:32:27.240
Who cares if the dream is borrowed
if I'm willing to fight for it?!

01:32:27.250 --> 01:32:28.290
To the end!

01:32:28.290 --> 01:32:33.120
You're pretty persistent.
I thought you'd be dead by now.

01:32:33.330 --> 01:32:34.830
Now disappear!

01:32:36.630 --> 01:32:38.300
Get back, Shiro!

01:32:43.260 --> 01:32:44.430
I'll take him.

01:32:44.430 --> 01:32:47.180
No, I can handle him alone, Saber!

01:32:47.180 --> 01:32:48.220
Shiro!

01:32:48.220 --> 01:32:51.810
Help Tosaka stop the Grail.

01:32:57.190 --> 01:32:58.320
Good luck.

01:32:59.400 --> 01:33:01.360
Are you nuts?

01:33:01.990 --> 01:33:06.530
Refusing the help of your Servant?

01:33:06.830 --> 01:33:12.210
I realized my trade isn't actually sword-making.

01:33:12.210 --> 01:33:15.880
It's harnessing the power of my mind!

01:33:22.430 --> 01:33:23.720
What?

01:33:24.590 --> 01:33:26.680
What l make...

01:33:27.970 --> 01:33:29.640
are whole worlds...

01:33:30.180 --> 01:33:32.270
of swords...

01:33:33.270 --> 01:33:35.310
in limitless quantity.

01:33:36.310 --> 01:33:38.150
l call it...

01:33:42.990 --> 01:33:46.280
"Unlimited Blade Works!"

01:33:53.540 --> 01:33:55.170
A magic circuit?

01:33:55.210 --> 01:33:57.290
These are all imitations.

01:33:57.460 --> 01:33:59.880
As you said, trivial to you.

01:34:00.130 --> 01:34:04.510
But who says imitations
can't cut like the real thing?

01:34:05.010 --> 01:34:08.850
Come on, Hero King! I'm fully armed!

01:34:09.220 --> 01:34:12.390
Don't get cocky, mongrel!

01:34:18.190 --> 01:34:19.480
Rin!

01:34:19.570 --> 01:34:22.110
No! Don't touch that magma!

01:34:23.280 --> 01:34:24.280
But...

01:34:24.280 --> 01:34:28.110
It's gonna burst. Shred it with a Noble Phantasm!

01:34:28.280 --> 01:34:31.870
Get out of there quickly! Leave the rest to me!

01:34:38.790 --> 01:34:40.920
Damn... we're trapped.

01:34:40.920 --> 01:34:44.630
Sorry, Shinji.

01:34:44.630 --> 01:34:46.260
Just go.

01:34:46.680 --> 01:34:49.470
I don't want to hear your whimpering.

01:35:09.740 --> 01:35:11.780
Saber! Do it now!

01:35:18.790 --> 01:35:19.960
Ex...

01:35:22.170 --> 01:35:24.840
...caliber!

01:35:42.650 --> 01:35:43.980
Saber!

01:36:07.260 --> 01:36:08.380
It can't be!

01:36:09.090 --> 01:36:12.640
Disappeared, huh? Pathetic girl.

01:36:19.480 --> 01:36:22.100
You bastard!

01:36:22.980 --> 01:36:25.520
Give it your best shot, boy!

01:36:45.920 --> 01:36:46.880
Impossible...!

01:36:52.930 --> 01:36:54.430
How can I...

01:36:58.100 --> 01:37:01.430
...lose to an imposter!

01:37:05.150 --> 01:37:07.900
Take that!

01:37:22.540 --> 01:37:25.210
No you don't!

01:37:44.230 --> 01:37:45.850
What the...?

01:38:13.920 --> 01:38:19.640
I thought you needed to feed on
a magician to complete yourself.

01:38:19.640 --> 01:38:23.310
I'm a Servant! What are you taking me for?

01:38:31.280 --> 01:38:33.230
Duck to your right.

01:38:37.740 --> 01:38:42.160
You... bastard...

01:38:43.580 --> 01:38:47.710
ARCHER!

01:39:12.690 --> 01:39:14.150
Archer!

01:39:18.410 --> 01:39:19.740
Archer.

01:39:20.240 --> 01:39:22.740
Be my Servant again.

01:39:24.580 --> 01:39:29.120
l'm sorry. l don't have that right.

01:39:29.120 --> 01:39:32.290
What's more... I'm done here.

01:39:33.090 --> 01:39:35.170
My battle is finished.

01:39:35.170 --> 01:39:39.800
But then... you'll forever be...

01:39:41.720 --> 01:39:46.640
All right, look. I leave this world with no regrets.

01:39:46.850 --> 01:39:52.020
But watch over "me," Rin.
I mean, the guy's helpless, right?

01:39:53.070 --> 01:39:54.610
Archer.

01:40:02.120 --> 01:40:05.990
Okay, l will. I'll do my best.

01:40:06.290 --> 01:40:10.420
I'll help him learn to value himself.

01:40:11.920 --> 01:40:14.170
So you do the same.

01:40:15.670 --> 01:40:17.670
I've got my answer.

01:40:18.260 --> 01:40:22.890
Don't worry, Tosaka. l won't let you down.

01:40:31.690 --> 01:40:33.150
Darn it....

01:40:33.150 --> 01:40:37.860
he didn't give me a chance to complain.

01:40:53.580 --> 01:40:57.800
Sometimes, I remember...
the clunky clang of metal.

01:41:00.050 --> 01:41:04.720
A blinding, obstinate duel in the distance.

01:41:07.140 --> 01:41:10.890
A clash of deep convictions.

01:41:13.440 --> 01:41:19.820
By forcing my aspirations,
I only wound up confronting myself.

01:41:21.950 --> 01:41:24.360
I don't have the answer yet.

01:41:24.820 --> 01:41:29.290
That probably won't come for a very long time.

01:41:57.150 --> 01:42:02.900
Kizutsuku koto bakari no hibi ni
Every day brings nothing but pain

01:42:03.240 --> 01:42:09.200
Omoi wa mukuwarenaimono nan datte
Love and compassion must go unrewarded

01:42:09.200 --> 01:42:14.080
Sonna fuu ni kanjite shimau yo
It isn't hard to start believing this is the way it has to be

01:42:14.080 --> 01:42:20.710
Haruka na yume e no tabi no tochuu de
On a journey to discover one's dreams

01:42:20.880 --> 01:42:23.550
Dakedo koko de tachi tomareba
I feel like all will be lost if I pause along the way

01:42:23.550 --> 01:42:26.930
Jibun ni makesou na kigashite
I feel like all will be lost if I pause along the way

01:42:26.930 --> 01:42:29.470
Kuchibiru wo gyutto
I bite down hard on my lip

01:42:29.470 --> 01:42:35.850
Kami shimeta yoru kikoetekita dareka no koe ga
I can hear a distant voice echo in the moonlight

01:42:35.850 --> 01:42:39.310
Tsukiakari ni hibikidashi
I can hear a distant voice echo in the moonlight

01:42:39.310 --> 01:42:51.410
Sono koe ga watashi wo tsuki ugokasunda
A voice that penetrates and stirs my soul

01:42:51.790 --> 01:42:57.790
Furimukeba itsudatte anata ga soba ni ite
Whenever I turn around you are always at my side

01:42:57.790 --> 01:43:02.630
Sotto yuuki kureta yo ne
Quietly feeding me with courage

01:43:02.840 --> 01:43:08.550
Miageta sora ni kagayaku ano hoshi no you ni
Like a star to guide me through the night

01:43:08.550 --> 01:43:11.510
Tadoritsuku basho
To a place

01:43:11.510 --> 01:43:20.350
Kaerubeki basho michibiiteku
A place that I call home

01:43:27.490 --> 01:43:33.580
Osanai hi no kioku
A memory from childhood

01:43:33.580 --> 01:43:39.040
Yobiokosu you na koe
A voice that wakes me from my slumber

01:43:39.040 --> 01:43:45.670
Yasashii kao ni mou nando mo tasukerareteiru kara
So many times your gentle face has saved me

01:43:45.670 --> 01:43:53.970
ltsu no hi ni ka kanki no uta wo todoketai yo
Someday I hope to send you a song of joy and praise

01:43:55.600 --> 01:44:01.650
Kigatsukeba itsudatte anata ga soba ni ite
Come to think of it you were always at my side

01:44:01.650 --> 01:44:06.190
Sotto yuuki kuretanda
Quietly feeding me with courage

01:44:06.190 --> 01:44:12.320
Tatta hitotsu futari wo terasu ano hoshi no you ni
Like a star that guides us through the night

01:44:12.320 --> 01:44:15.370
Tadoritsuku basho
To a place

01:44:15.370 --> 01:44:25.710
Kaerubeki basho michibiiteku
A place that I call home

01:44:46.190 --> 01:44:52.740
There is nothing left to say

01:44:53.530 --> 01:45:00.330
The boy remains, while He departs

01:45:01.670 --> 01:45:05.710
Leaving only the memory of clashing swords

01:45:07.250 --> 01:45:11.220
Along a distant path... a faint echo as a guide...

01:45:17.310 --> 01:45:25.860
A young man heads toward the wilderness
